<!--
  Popby Realty savings calculator widget styles.
  Everything is scoped under .pb-calc and prefixed "pb-" by the widget's
  own design, so emitting it globally is safe. It has to be global: the
  widget script rewrites several regions with innerHTML, and those nodes
  never receive Astro's scoping attribute.
